description	"The Jedi Guardian

A combat oriented Jedi class that focuses primarily, though not exclusively, on lightsaber abilities. Their force powers, however, tend to suffer to compensate for the imbalance.

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber
-- ^3Yellow ^7/ ^1Red ^7/ ^6Purple ^7/ ^4Blue ^7Styles
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense / Deflect (2)
-- Attack-Defense (Q3)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (3)
- Push  (2)
- Pull  (2)
- Sense (1)
- Speed (2)
- Lightning (2)
- Grip  (2)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^2Strengths^7: Use of attack-defense and excellent saber-saber combat abilities.
^1Weaknesses^7: Weak against anti-jedi bounty-hunters, cortosis SBDs, Wookiees and Sith Force users."